universe_common
---------------
w1: $ G , m = cpr a b , m ∊ o ∧ universe o ⇒ m ∊ o ∧ universe o $ by ax
w2: $ … ⇒ m ∊ o $ by and_elim_l [w1]
w3: $ … ⇒ universe o $ by and_elim_r [w1]
