universe_cxp
------------
l1: $ G , z ∊ a × b ⇒ z ∊ a × b $ by ax
l2: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b ⇒ u ∊ a $ by ax
l3: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b ⇒ v ∊ b $ by ax
l4: $ … ⇒ u ∊ a ∪ b $ by cun_intro_l [l2]
l5: $ … ⇒ v ∊ a ∪ b $ by cun_intro_r [l3]
l6: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ cpr (csn u) (cpr u v) $ by ax
l7: $ … ⇒ w = csn u ∨ w = cpr u v $ by cpr_elim [l6]
l8: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = csn u ⇒ w = csn u $ by ax
l9: $ … ⇒ csn u = w $ by eq_sym [l8]
l10: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = csn u ⇒ u ∊ a ∪ b $ by weaken [l4]
l11: $ … ⇒ csn u ⊆ a ∪ b $ by csn_subset [l10]
l12: $ … ⇒ w ⊆ a ∪ b $ by subset_eq_l [l9, l11]
l13: $ … ⇒ w ∊ 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by cpw_intro [l12]
l14: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = cpr u v ⇒ w = cpr u v $ by ax
l15: $ … ⇒ cpr u v = w $ by eq_sym [l14]
l16: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = cpr u v ⇒ u ∊ a ∪ b $ by weaken [l4]
l17: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = cpr u v ⇒ v ∊ a ∪ b $ by weaken [l5]
l18: $ … ⇒ cpr u v ⊆ a ∪ b $ by cpr_subset [l16, l17]
l19: $ … ⇒ w ⊆ a ∪ b $ by subset_eq_l [l15, l18]
l20: $ … ⇒ w ∊ 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by cpw_intro [l19]
l21: $ … ⇒ w ∊ 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by or_elim [l7, l13, l20]
l22: $ … ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ ⊆ 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by subset_intro [l21]
l23: $ G , z ∊ a × b , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ a , v ∊ b ⇒ z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by ax
l24: $ … ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [l23]
l25: $ … ⇒ z ⊆ 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by subset_eq_l [l24, l22]
l26: $ … ⇒ z ∊ 𝒫 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by cpw_intro [l25]
l27: $ … ⇒ z ∊ 𝒫 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by cxp_elim [l1, l26]
l28: $ … ⇒ a × b ⊆ 𝒫 𝒫 (a ∪ b) $ by subset_intro [l27]
l29: $ … ⇒ a ∪ b ∈ U $ by universe_cun [#1, #2, #3]
l30: $ … ⇒ 𝒫 (a ∪ b) ∈ U $ by universe_cpw_c [#1, l29]
l31: $ … ⇒ 𝒫 𝒫 (a ∪ b) ∈ U $ by universe_cpw_c [#1, l30]
l32: $ … ⇒ a × b ∈ U $ by universe_subset_c [#1, l31, l28]

