n1: $ G , (m = n ∨ n ∊ m) , n ∊ m ⇒ n ∊ m $ by ax
n2: $ G , (m = n ∨ n ∊ m) , n ∊ m ⇒ m ⊆ n $ by weaken [#3]
n3: $ … ⇒ n ∊ n $ by subset_elim [n2, n1]
n4: $ … ⇒ ⊥ $ by notin_self [n3]
n5: $ … ⇒ uni' m ⊆ uni' n $ by bot_elim [n4]
k1: $ … ⇒ uni' m ⊆ uni' n $ by or_elim [e0, e4, n5]
k2: $ … ⇒ uni' m ⊆ uni' n $ by or_elim [t1, j3, k1]

uni_least
---------
k1: $ G , v = uni' n , v ∊ U , z = ω , z ∊ U ⇒ v ∊ U $ by ax
k2: $ G , v = uni' n , v ∊ U , z = ω , z ∊ U ⇒ z ∊ U $ by ax
k3: $ G , v = uni' n , v ∊ U , z = ω , z ∊ U ⇒ universe U $ by weaken [#2]
k4: $ … ⇒ cpr v z ∈ U $ by universe_cpr [k3, k1, k2]
k5: $ G , v = uni' n , v ∊ U , z = ω , z ∊ U ⇒ v = uni' n $ by ax
k6: $ G , v = uni' n , v ∊ U , z = ω , z ∊ U ⇒ z = ω $ by ax
k7: $ … ⇒ cpr v z = cpr (uni' n) ω $ by cpr_eq [k5, k6]
k8: $ … ⇒ cpr (uni' n) ω ∈ U $ by wcel_eq_l [k7, k4]
k9a: $ G , v = uni' n , v ∊ U ⇒ ω ∈ U $ by weaken [#4]
k9: $ … ⇒ cpr (uni' n) ω ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [k9a, k8]
k10: $ … ⇒ cpr (uni' n) ω ∈ U $ by wcel_elim [#3, k9]
k11: $ … ⇒ nextu (cpr (uni' n) ω) ⊆ U $ by nextu_least_c [#2, k10]
k12: $ … ⇒ uni' (suc n) = nextu (cpr (uni' n) ω) $ by uni_suc [#1]
k13: $ … ⇒ nextu (cpr (uni' n) ω) = uni' (suc n) $ by eq_sym [k12]
k14: $ … ⇒ uni' (suc n) ⊆ U $ by subset_eq_l [k13, k11]
